WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.210
It's great to be back from the Thanksgiving
holiday here in the United States.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.230
I didn't do much.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.529
I will talk about it on the bonus show.

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:13.440
And the reason I didn't do much is with vaccines
for coronavirus so close.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:20.009
Why would I do anything at this crucial time
with light at the end of the tunnel to make

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:23.550
the spread potentially even worse?

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.929
And unfortunately, it looks like it's going
to get really, really bad.

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:32.590
We don't yet have the numbers that will tell
us the impact of the Thanksgiving travel.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:38.650
Reportedly almost as many people as in a normal
year, a non pandemic year flying around for

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:39.650
Thanksgiving.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:44.050
We won't know the impact of that in terms
of cases for a couple of weeks and in terms

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.750
of deaths for a couple of more weeks.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.600
Beyond that, because of the timeline of these
spike and super spreader events.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.770
But even without the numbers that will be
caused by Thanksgiving travel and gatherings,

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:02.340
the United States coronavirus pandemic is
completely out of control.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.870
And Donald Trump insisted in the run up to
the election that it was all political after

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:08.870
the election.

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.479
You're not going to hear anything else about
the virus.

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:14.719
November 4th, everything, open schools, everything,
everything, everything opens.

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:16.999
Obviously, this has not happened.

00:01:16.999 --> 00:01:18.979
And the opposite is actually the truth.

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:25.270
In terms of cases per capita, the United States
has risen to sixth, most cases per capita

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:29.880
in the world, excluding a couple of really
tiny countries and territories, places like

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.170
Andorra, which kind of throw off the data.

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:37.380
Similarly, when it comes to deaths using that
same standard, the United States has the seventh

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:43.009
highest rate of deaths per capita in the world.

00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:49.479
These are horrifying numbers now in terms
of cases and deaths in the U.S.

00:01:49.479 --> 00:01:52.319
The U.S. now has roughly.

00:01:52.319 --> 00:01:59.049
Thirteen point seven million known cases and
two hundred and seventy three thousand known

00:01:59.049 --> 00:02:00.399
deaths.

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:06.459
The numbers for both could be 30 or even 50
percent higher, as we've previously described.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.599
Remember, Trump said 15 cases will soon be
zero.

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:11.150
Nobody here has died.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:15.080
We might have 50000 deaths, maybe, but probably
not.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.540
And on and on and on.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.740
We are at two hundred and seventy three thousand.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:21.519
Nothing is being done at this point in time.

00:02:21.519 --> 00:02:29.381
Now, recall that we had a spike in April to
about 32000 cases per day, and at the time

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.659
it looked like a big spike.

00:02:31.659 --> 00:02:33.370
And then they dipped back down.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:38.710
And then we had a second spike in July that
doubled that up to about 70000 cases per day.

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:42.050
And it seemed crazy and they started to decline.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:48.910
But Dr. Foushee said, if we are not careful,
we will get beyond 100000 cases per day in

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.099
the fall.

00:02:50.099 --> 00:02:53.440
And half the country didn't believe Dr. Anthony
Fauci.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:58.360
And looking at the chart of those cases, those
initial spikes now look like mere molehills

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:03.010
compared to the current numbers where we saw
as many as one hundred and seventy eight thousand

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:06.040
cases in a single day a few days ago.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:11.489
Now, over the last few days, because of the
holiday, combined with weekend reporting,

00:03:11.489 --> 00:03:15.319
which tends to be lower, we see a bit of a
dip.

00:03:15.319 --> 00:03:19.700
We expect to see those numbers caught up on
in the next few days.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:25.629
And of course, it's not just cases, it's also
deaths, deaths spiking.

00:03:25.629 --> 00:03:31.110
We are back up to the numbers of that horrible
early spike of about 2000 deaths a day.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:35.150
We even had 2300 deaths in a single day last
week.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:40.310
And it is completely possible and plausible
that these numbers are going to keep climbing

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.290
due to Thanksgiving gatherings now heading
into Christmas and New Year's.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:48.230
There are people who are just determined to
live as if everything is completely normal,

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.959
large indoor gatherings.

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:51.549
It is going to be insane.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:56.190
Now, as I mentioned earlier, we are very close
to vaccines.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:04:00.079
We are expecting at this point it is it is
no longer a pipedream.

00:04:00.079 --> 00:04:06.930
We are expecting that there will be people
being vaccinated on either December 11th or

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.439
December 12th, December eight to 10.

00:04:09.439 --> 00:04:14.370
The FDA's meeting with these nonpartisan advisory
boards to say, are we doing an emergency use

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:18.880
authorization, at least for the Fizer vaccine?

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:23.090
And then we'll see if the Moderna vaccine,
it would be discussed at that same time.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:25.500
Or maybe that will take a little bit longer.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.510
If that is the case.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.300
Vaccines are already being transported.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:35.150
United Airlines flights bringing vaccines
from Belgium to Chicago for further distribution.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.570
The logistics are on the move.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.789
We are this close.

00:04:38.789 --> 00:04:42.800
We could have twenty million people vaccinated
by the end of December.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:47.650
We could have another 30 million by the end
of January, another 30 to 35 million by the

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:48.650
end of February.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:53.960
So what that means is that in the next three
months, it's basically December by the in

00:04:53.960 --> 00:05:01.550
December, January, February, we could potentially
have 80 to 85 million people vaccinated by

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.740
the last day of February.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.530
We are getting close.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:12.810
This is not the time to behave irresponsibly
and see this absolutely almost cartoonish

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.120
rise in cases.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:20.090
Dr. Fauci saying to Martha Raddatz over the
weekend that you could see this looks like

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.280
a surge.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:27.780
You could see Thanksgiving and Christmas accelerated
even more to a surge upon a surge.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.479
Let's not do it.

00:05:29.479 --> 00:05:30.479
This has nothing.

00:05:30.479 --> 00:05:31.479
Trump failed.

00:05:31.479 --> 00:05:32.560
Yes, Trump failed.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.380
Trump's got days left in his presidency.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:41.330
Let's get this under control because we are
so, so close and we'll keep you posted on

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.500
the numbers and the data.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.830
But it is looking very, very ugly so far

